{
  "key": 18239,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_Yahoo",
      "en_US": "Yahoo!\r",
      "fr_FR": "Youhou!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_IGotSomethingCool",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "I got something cool.\n",
        "I’ll show you as a special favor!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "J’ai un truc super cool. Je vais te\n",
        "faire une fleur et te le montrer!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_CheckOutTheRuins",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh?\n",
        "What the...\r",
        "What’s this all about?\r",
        "...I got some Seals, but I forgot to\n",
        "put them on.\r",
        "Oh, right.\n",
        "It’s because I was at the ruins.\r",
        "The ruins here are cool.\n",
        "You have to check it out.\r",
        "I even found a Hidden Machine.\n",
        "It was Defog!\r",
        "Anyway, I’ll battle you another time.\n",
        "See ya!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hein?\n",
        "Qu’est-ce que...\r",
        "Qu’est-ce qui se passe?\r",
        "J’ai des Sceaux, mais j’ai oublié\n",
        "de les emporter.\r",
        "Oh, c’est vrai. C’est parce que\n",
        "j’étais dans les ruines.\r",
        "Il faut absolument les visiter!\n",
        "C’est un endroit super cool.\r",
        "J’y ai même trouvé une Capsule Secrète\n",
        "contenant la capacité Anti-Brume!\r",
        "Bref, on se battra une autre fois.\n",
        "A plus!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_BreathingInRefreshingAir",
      "en_US": [
        "Breathing in this refreshing air...\n",
        "It perks up Pokémon, don’t you think?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aaaah, tu sens ce bon air frais?\n",
        "Il requinque même les Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_TakeItEasy",
      "en_US": [
        "Howdy, traveling Trainer.\n",
        "Take it easy, slow, and casual."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bien le bonjour, globe-trotter.\n",
        "Cool, relax, prends ton temps."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_TakeATour",
      "en_US": [
        "Howdy, traveling Trainer.\n",
        "There’s nothing here.\r",
        "Well, nothing but plenty of time to\n",
        "think, anyway.\r",
        "Oh, right. We have the ruins here.\n",
        "Why not take a tour through that?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bien le bonjour, globe-trotter.\n",
        "Il n’y a rien ici.\r",
        "Enfin, rien à part plein de temps\n",
        "pour réfléchir.\r",
        "Ah, si, il y a quand même les ruines.\n",
        "Pourquoi tu n’irais pas y faire un tour?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_ImTooLittle",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m too little, so I don’t know\n",
        "how to battle very good.\r",
        "The nice Day-Care Lady is raising\n",
        "my Pokémon for me."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je suis encore toute petite, je ne\n",
        "sais pas vraiment me battre.\r",
        "La gentille Hôtesse de la Pension\n",
        "s’occupe de mes Pokémon pour moi."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_IVisitTheLostTower",
      "en_US": [
        "Every Sunday, I visit the Lost\n",
        "Tower..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Chaque dimanche, je me\n",
        "recueille dans la Tour Perdue..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_UsedToBeNothing",
      "en_US": [
        "There used to be nothing here but\n",
        "a road that went straight through.\r",
        "Over time, Pokémon and people just\n",
        "gathered, and the town came to be."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Avant, il n’y avait rien ici, juste\n",
        "une route qui traversait la plaine.\r",
        "Les Pokémon et les gens se sont réunis\n",
        "au fil du temps pour fonder cette ville."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_IfCompetentMetFiftyPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "A traveling Trainer, huh?\r",
        "Tell me, how many kinds of Pokémon\n",
        "have you met so far?\r",
        "If you’re a competent Trainer, I’d\n",
        "think you’d’ve met at least fifty.\r",
        "If you haven’t, go farther abroad and\n",
        "search wider, youngster."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Un Dresseur vagabond, hein?\r",
        "Dis-moi, combien d’espèces de Pokémon\n",
        "as-tu rencontrées jusque-là?\r",
        "Si tu es un bon Dresseur, j’imagine que\n",
        "tu as dû en voir au moins cinquante.\r",
        "Si ce n’est pas le cas, repars \n",
        "à l’aventure et ouvre l’œil."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_PoketchAppPokemonHistory",
      "en_US": [
        "Your encounters with Pokémon can\n",
        "be considered your shared history.\r",
        "This here’s a Pokétch app called\n",
        "Pokémon History.\r",
        "Use it to see your history of\n",
        "Pokémon catches.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "A partir du moment où tu captures un\n",
        "Pokémon, il fait partie de ton histoire.\r",
        "Voici un logiciel Pokémontre appelé\n",
        "Historique Pokémon.\r",
        "Utilise-le pour connaître l’historique\n",
        "de tes captures de Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_EachPokemonOwnHistory",
      "en_US": [
        "You have your history, and each\n",
        "Pokémon has its own history.\r",
        "When the two collide, new drama\n",
        "is born."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu as ton histoire et chaque Pokémon\n",
        "a la sienne.\r",
        "Lorsque ces deux histoires se \n",
        "recoupent, une nouvelle commence."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_MapSign",
      "en_US": [
        "Solaceon Town\n",
        "Free of Worry!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bonville\n",
        "Ville sans-souci"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SignPokemonDayCare",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon Day Care\n",
        "Let Us Raise Your Pokémon"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Pension Pokémon\n",
        "Nous élevons vos Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTown_Text_SignPokemonNewsPress",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon News Press\n",
        "Wanted: Pro Pokémon Catcher!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "La Dépêche Pokémon\n",
        "Recherchons pro de la capture!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}